Jeżeli w plecaku będziemy mieli przynajmniej 3 kiście zimowych jagód i porozmawiamy z nią: hi - mission - yes - yes - przeniesie nas na teren eventu.","location_description":"koło północnej bramy Thais","npc_lines":["Hello helpful citizen Jogador! Finally!","We agents of the Combined Magical Winterberry Society try to ensure the harvesting and processing of winterberries into all sorts of useful, magical fluids. ...","AND we have an important mission for you - yes you. One that will influence practically all of Tibia.","Winterberries are special berries only harvestable during a short time of the year. They are used to refine potions of all sorts. They can severely enhance their magical effects. ...","Without them it is generally a little more difficult to create effective potions.","The Combined Magical Winterberry Society was founded more than one hundred years ago by mage Tolwyn Winter. ...","It's our duty to ensure the harvesting and processing of winterberries to secure a steady flow of the appropriate magical resources for potions and other magical fluids in this world.","We oversee the treading of winterberries in all of Tibia. The processed berries will be used to refine magical potions such as health or mana potions.","Ahem... WELCOME! The Combined Magical Winterberry Society is proud to have you on board... mumble... mmh... which thank you very much... in our humble opinion... is our duty to... mumble ...","And that is why you are here now. To help us, yourself and everyone around you of course. Are you ready to join us and do you have at least 3 bunches of winterberries with you?","Good! Then I'm officially allowed and encouraged to transport you to one of our cellars. Are you prepared to leave?","Just perfect! Have a safe journey! And good treading..."],"npc_lines_semantics":"source_utterances_without_trigger_or_state_assignment","profession":"członkini Towarzystwa Jagód","quest_references":[{"label":"Annual Autumn Vintage","url":"https://tibiopedia.pl/q